%% Control command protocol (designed; store implemented). Explained in: docs/flows/Control_Command_Flow.md
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Analyst/Playbook
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant NS as Node sensor*
    A->>GW: kill run X
    GW->>GW: canonical cmd (aegis-command-jcs-1)<br/>tenant+target+nonce+expiry → Ed25519 sign*
    GW->>GW: persist to control_commands (idempotency)
    NS->>GW: poll commands*
    GW-->>NS: signed command
    NS->>NS: verify sig/tenant/target/expiry/nonce
    alt invalid
        NS-->>GW: NACK (fail closed)
    else valid
        NS->>NS: typed handler executes
        NS-->>GW: signed ACK → receipt + timeline
    end
